# Super-Market-Management-System-UI

Frontend UI for the **Supermarket Management System**, designed and developed for **EGOTECH WORLD**.

---

## Project Overview

This project focuses on creating a modern, responsive, and user-friendly **Supermarket Management System interface**. The UI was designed to provide an efficient experience for managing supermarket operations through a clean dashboard and Point of Sale (POS) interface.

The project follows a reusable component architecture by separating common UI elements such as the **Sidebar, Topbar, and Footer** into individual components and integrating them into the main system pages.

---

## Technologies Used

* HTML5
* CSS3
* JavaScript
* Bootstrap 5
* Figma (UI Design)

---

